{"id":217,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"When the cold season arrives in Hisui, this Pokémon will wander fields and mountains alike in search of its favorite berries. Ursaring's hunger during this time makes it a ferocious danger."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"In the forests inhabited by Ursaring, it is said that there are many streams and towering trees where they gather food. This Pokémon walks through its forest gathering food every day."},{"games":["Y","Crystal"],"text":"Although it has a large body, it is quite skilled at climbing trees. It eats and sleeps in the treetops."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"With its ability to distinguish any aroma, it unfailingly finds all food buried deep underground."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"In its territory, it leaves scratches on trees that bear delicious berries or fruits."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Although it is a good climber, it prefers to snap trees with its forelegs and eat fallen berries."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"Although it is a good climber, it prefers to snap stout trees with its forelegs and eat fallen BERRIES."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"With its ability to distinguish any smell, it unfailingly finds all food buried deep underground."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"In forests, it is said that there are many streams and towering trees where an URSARING gathers food. It walks through its forest collecting food every day."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Guts","hidden":false,"description":"It's so gutsy that having a status condition boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat."},{"name":"Quick Feet","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Speed stat if the Pokémon has a status condition."},{"name":"Unnerve","hidden":true,"description":"Unnerves opposing Pokémon and makes them unable to eat Berries."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growth